[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "正定的充分必要条件是顺序主子式全大于0，故",
        "bbox": [
            178,
            80,
            552,
            98
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/ef94aca84b896bb9b9a4685660a831ebf9a5db7648bb78100dc6a38e069e6bc6.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{aligned} 4 - t ^ { 2 } = ( 2 - t ) ( 2 + t ) > 0 , \\quad t \\in ( - 2 , 2 ) , \\\\ - 4 t ^ { 2 } - 4 t + 8 = - 4 ( t - 1 ) ( t + 2 ) > 0 , \\quad t \\in ( - 2 , 1 ) , \\end{aligned} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            104,
            677,
            151
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $t \\in (-2,1)$ 时，二次型f正定.",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            156,
            452,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例16【分析】A正定⇔A的特征值 $\\lambda > 0.$",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            209,
            579,
            230
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/708d0f9a4dd33d3ade97ca4726802c3ffcfc5cc45e69da2d37a1e323131fb8de.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left| \\lambda \\boldsymbol{E} - \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| &=\\left| \\begin{matrix}\\lambda & -1 & -1 \\\\-1 & \\lambda - 2 & -1 \\\\-1 & -1 & \\lambda\\end{matrix} \\right|= \\left| \\begin{matrix}\\lambda + 1 & 0 & -\\lambda - 1 \\\\-1 & \\lambda - 2 & -1 \\\\-1 & -1 & \\lambda\\end{matrix} \\right| \\\\&= \\lambda (\\lambda + 1) (\\lambda - 3)  .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            237,
            697,
            331
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "A 的特征值为 $;0,-1,3$",
        "bbox": [
            208,
            340,
            410,
            356
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "A+E的特征值为 $k,k-1,k+3.$",
        "bbox": [
            208,
            365,
            495,
            381
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\boldsymbol{A} + k\\boldsymbol{E}$ 正定 $\\Leftrightarrow \\begin{cases} k > 0   , \\\\ k - 1 > 0   , \\\\ k + 3 > 0 \\end{cases} \\Leftrightarrow     k > 1.$",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            390,
            542,
            456
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例17【证】因A正定 $\\Rightarrow A^{\\mathrm{T}} = A, A$ 可逆且 $\\mid \\boldsymbol{A} \\mid > 0.$",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            491,
            667,
            512
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由 $\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right)^{\\mathrm{T}} = \\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{\\mathrm{T}} \\right)^{*} = \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\Rightarrow \\boldsymbol{A}^{*}$ 是对称矩阵.",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            520,
            564,
            538
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "方法一用定义.因A可逆,故 $x = A y$ 是坐标变换，且 $\\forall x \\neq 0$ 必有 $y \\ne \\mathbf{0}$ ,那么 $\\forall x \\neq 0$",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            546,
            719,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/f4ec5770298c6b7ffce474c09ab389e52535206b1a08e87027a50199c5769e48.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nx^{\\mathrm{T}} A^{*} x = \\left( A y \\right)^{\\mathrm{T}} A^{*} \\left( A y \\right) = y^{\\mathrm{T}} \\left( \\left| A \\right| A \\right) y = \\left| A \\right| y^{\\mathrm{T}} A y,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            599,
            690,
            621
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因A正定， $\\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| > 0, \\boldsymbol{y}^{\\mathrm{T}} \\boldsymbol{A} \\boldsymbol{y} > 0$ ,从而 $\\forall x \\ne 0, x^{\\mathrm{T}} A^{*} x = | A | y^{\\mathrm{T}} A y >$ 0,故 $A^{\\bullet}$ 正定.",
        "bbox": [
            173,
            627,
            717,
            671
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "方法二 用特征值.设 $A^{*} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = \\lambda \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} , \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} \\neq \\mathbf{0}$ ,于是",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            678,
            591,
            696
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/8a7de3adfbfca185d68d8b3635b666e5e589a6171957cb3cf11d580eaafc5164.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = \\lambda \\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} ,  即  \\lambda \\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right|\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            314,
            703,
            573,
            720
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由A可逆知 $A^{*}$ 必可逆，那么 $A^{*}$ 的特征值 $\\lambda \\ne 0$",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            728,
            608,
            745
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "从而有 $A\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = \\frac{\\left |  A\\right | }{\\lambda }\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}$ ,即 $\\frac{\\left| \\begin{array}{c}  A  \\end{array} \\right|}{\\lambda}$ 是A的特征值.",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            752,
            571,
            785
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因A正定，得 $\\frac{1}{\\lambda} \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| > 0$ ,而 $|A|>0$ ,故必有 $\\lambda > 0$ ,故 $A^{*}$ 正定.",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            794,
            712,
            826
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
